+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ *
+ * Software SHA-2.
+ *
+ * The corecrypto wrappers all dereference g_crypto_funcs, which is only
+ * installed by the Apple corecrypto kext.  No such kext on this board, so
+ * every digest call has to be served in the kernel itself.  Scalar code is
+ * plenty: the hot paths hash a few dozen bytes.
